{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/74d10eae303a6d048d714bd9c2091031.poster.avif?t=1749030384\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/74d10eae303a6d048d714bd9c2091031.webm?t=1749030384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophie is blind, alone, and lost in a crumbling mansion. Her only hope? You, her beloved teddy bear. In Out of Sight VR, you\u2019ll see the world through Teddy\u2019s eyes and guide Sophie, navigating a world of creeping shadows and haunting secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/fb217c68555be5bc06b23a923e373dc5.poster.avif?t=1749030384\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/fb217c68555be5bc06b23a923e373dc5.webm?t=1749030384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip the perspective and take control in a genre-defying second-person VR experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This groundbreaking second-person VR horror flips the script on traditional perspective. As Teddy, you\u2019re Sophie\u2019s only friend - and only lifeline. Strategically position yourself to scout dangers, uncover hidden paths, and lead Sophie away from the sinister figures hunting her every move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/d447a5226c41b4080c907691421aad16.poster.avif?t=1749030384\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/d447a5226c41b4080c907691421aad16.webm?t=1749030384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension hangs on every breath, and each movement must be planned with care. One wrong step, one creak of the floorboards, and Sophie could be caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face perspective-shifting chase sequences, solve second-perspective puzzles, and uncover the tragic history buried within the mansion\u2019s walls. As fear builds and reality fractures, the line between protector and prisoner begins to blur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/be408b59a981f7648da3c1cd91fbac41.poster.avif?t=1749030384\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/be408b59a981f7648da3c1cd91fbac41.webm?t=1749030384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the haunting past hidden inside the walls and within Sophie herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dripping with atmosphere and driven by emotional stakes, Out of Sight VR is more than your standard horror game. Every choice you make as Teddy could mean survival...or silence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/a0e27e3489f6751d35d6efd56ce11e55.poster.avif?t=1749030384\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/extras/a0e27e3489f6751d35d6efd56ce11e55.webm?t=1749030384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"William's Tractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/71edc1f45da7218e66778cfe876d091016bdc8c1.jpg"},{"name":"Afia's Robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/59c739a1e2a2de31999e988d5c53e5649374fc30.jpg"},{"name":"Clara's Colours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/f15fbad984a9af9b9f1efe001fa3e2fa6f49e490.jpg"},{"name":"Aiko's Train","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/9cfb8ffd702d89a7abb52d6ffb20e5477a50304e.jpg"},{"name":"Radha's Spinner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/9c2c3e66c6cb78fd033473f118f4d420b6375bf2.jpg"},{"name":"Emma's Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/a552cd76d1159e9be540e0862c6a0dd4f943874a.jpg"},{"name":"Lian's Airplane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/793a58aa9f83ea8391217e89f8082f3efc63ed1e.jpg"},{"name":"Lucille's Blanket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/670200daade8426a0b8ef0d44c50196239497be7.jpg"},{"name":"Clayton's Hearing Aid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/e2cf995f4de70e0bc199e7039eda605aef510304.jpg"},{"name":"Haruto\u2019s Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558720/e18b89c20e6892b8628ef5a0f6a2ee4d22ceb832.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558720?t=1749030384","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558720/9fc75c6eaed68df2d9416db65f47735a5716315d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749030384","capsule_image":"https://shared.